capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to release per-request auction JSON scratch buffers."
capability memoryBufferReadWriteCapability memory.buffer readWrite
purpose operation memoryBufferReadWriteCapability "Authority to read and compare auction command request buffers."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to read parsed auction command JSON documents."
capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to serialize auction response JSON documents."
