purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority required by auction handlers that call shared bearer-token helpers."
capability sqliteDatabaseReader database read
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReader "Authority to execute auction read-only SQLite statements."
capability sqliteDatabaseReadWriter database readWrite
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReadWriter "Authority to execute auction command SQLite transactions."
capability processEnvironmentReader process.environment read
purpose operation processEnvironmentReader "Authority used by shared auth helpers to read deployment auth configuration."

